<title>UK: B.A.T denies building ITC stake.</title>
<headline>B.A.T denies building ITC stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's B.A.T Industries Plc is not building a stake in India's ITC, a spokesman from B.A.T said on Thursday in response to Indian newspaper reports.</p>
<p>&quot;If we were building a stake in ITC, we would not do it through the foreign investor route in the stockmarket,&quot; said the spokesman for B.A.T.</p>
<p>Indian newspapers had reported that BAT had bought 700,000 ITC shares in an effort to increase its 31 percent stake in the company.</p>
